cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  Cite the exact GPUPDAL release or commit; also cite upstream PDAL when
  appropriate.
type: software
title: GPUPDAL
version: 0.1.0-dev
abstract: >-
  GPUPDAL (GPU Point Data Abstraction Library) provides a PDAL-compatible
  command that conservatively selects exact CPU and CUDA point-cloud
  processing implementations using measured end-to-end performance.
repository-code: https://github.com/zymazza/GPUPDAL
license: BSD-3-Clause
